---
source: tests/golden.rs
expression: stdout
---
basin — manage basin-cloud projects from the terminal.

USAGE
  basin [global flags] <command> [args]

GLOBAL FLAGS
  --api-url=<url>    Override the API endpoint (default https://api.basin.run).
  --token=<pat>      Use this PAT instead of the on-disk config.
  --org=<slug>       Use the per-org token from the config file.
  --json             Emit machine-readable JSON.
  -q, --quiet        Suppress non-essential output.
  --no-color         Disable ANSI colour in tables.
  -h, --help         Show this help.

ENVIRONMENT
  BASIN_TOKEN        Same as --token.
  BASIN_API          Same as --api-url.
  XDG_CONFIG_HOME    Where to look for config.json (default ~/.config).
  NO_COLOR           Disable ANSI colour (any non-empty value).

COMMANDS
  login              Sign in by pasting a personal access token.
  logout             Forget the locally-stored token.
  whoami             Print the active user + accessible orgs.
  orgs               List / get / create / update / delete orgs + branding.
  members            List / invite / remove / role-change org members.
  invitations        List / resend / revoke pending org invitations.
  projects           List / get / create / delete / pause / resume projects.
  dev                Start a local basin-server instance for development.
  stop               Stop the local basin-server stack (Docker Compose mode).
  init               Scaffold a basin project directory (./basin/).
  link               Bind ./basin/ to a remote project (writes project_ref).
  status             Show the linked project + migration drift summary.
  unlink             Remove the project binding from ./basin/config.toml.
  sql                Run a SQL query against a project.
  tx                 Open an interactive transaction REPL (begin/commit/rollback).
  dump               Export a project's schema + data (pg_dump-shaped, plain or custom format).
  restore            Replay a dump file into a project (inverse of `basin dump`).
  migrate-from-pg    Guided Postgres → Basin migration with --dry-run + --resume (T27.1).
  rpc                Invoke a user-defined database function (T26.4).
  db                 Push / pull / diff / reset / url / dump / lint the project database.
  tables             List / describe / create / alter / drop tables + CSV import/export.
  rows               Insert / update / delete rows in a project table.
  storage            Manage object storage buckets and objects (engine 5.17).
  functions          Deploy JS/TS edge functions to the Wasm component runtime (5.11.W).
  rls                Enable / disable RLS + manage row-level security policies.
  migrations         List / apply / new / get / diff / rollback DDL migrations.
  branches           List / create / get / merge / delete / events on project branches.
  gen                Generate typed bindings (ts/go/py/ruby/rust/java/csharp/php/dart/swift) from schema.
  snapshots          List / create / restore project snapshots.
  backups            Manage backup policy / snapshots / restore jobs.
  logs               Stream live project logs (or poll history).
  realtime           Subscribe to table event streams over SSE (T26.1).
  api-keys           List / create / rotate / revoke project-scoped API keys.
  pgwire             Show / reveal / rotate pgwire credentials and engine JWT keys.
  domains            Add / verify / cert / list / remove custom project domains.
  webhooks           Manage project webhooks: create / patch / test / redeliver / deliveries.
  alerts             Manage alert rules + view fired events.
  audit              List org audit events (--org=<slug> required).
  activity           List project activity events.
  metrics            Show project or org metrics (--range / --metric).
  erd                Export project ERD (svg / dot / json).
  queries            Save / list / get / fork / delete / history SQL queries.
  engine-pin         Get / put / delete / events on the project's engine version pin.
  extensions         List the project's installed engine extensions.
  oauth-providers    List / get / set / delete project OAuth providers.
  email              Manage project email templates + view allowance.
  byo                Configure bring-your-own bucket / kms / engine.
  saml               Get / put / test / enable / disable org SAML SSO.
  scim               SCIM config + provisioning tokens.
  oauth-apps         Manage org OAuth applications (clients).
  explain            Run EXPLAIN [ANALYZE] on a SQL statement via the cloud proxy.
  index-advisor      Show JSONB index recommendations for the project's tables.
  replication-slots  List / create / drop logical replication slots (CDC / Debezium).
  docs               Open docs.basin.run for a given subcommand.
  secrets            List / set / remove project env-overrides.
  tokens             Manage org-scoped personal access tokens.
  config             Read or write CLI config (telemetry, default org).
  completion         Print a shell completion script for bash, zsh, or fish.
  version            Print binary version + build metadata.
  help               Show help for the CLI or a subcommand.

Run `basin help <command>` for command-specific flags.
